		{"id":"36e5669217021f3a","type":"file","file":"New Readers Start Here/I - Pleroma Archive/World/Historical Eras/I - Lithic Era. (Origins)/(2026) The Specter of Communism.md","x":109,"y":25882,"width":400,"height":400,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"2822b27c43687f24","type":"text","text":"Fall of the West\nAs the Global elite ensured their  grip on power they began the plans to shape the world in their image. With corruption and progressive propaganda such as race guilt. Western ideals began to crack at the core yet the progressive world cheered on as the fires of liberty come crashing down.\n","x":109,"y":26282,"width":400,"height":400,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ac7d7786d64b3ac3","type":"text","text":"Military Defection\nMuch like the government predicted decades ago, with the civil war now in full swing much of the military had defected and is not aiding the nationalists not only in a domestic war but on in subterfuge.\n","x":109,"y":26682,"width":400,"height":400,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"4578ea8c94529f9a","type":"file","file":"New Readers Start Here/I - Pleroma Archive/World/Historical Eras/I - Lithic Era. (Origins)/(2027) The Rise of Nationalism.md","x":109,"y":27082,"width":400,"height":400,"color":"6"},
