		{"id":"1f6a950dee6f3121","type":"file","file":"New Readers Start Here/I - Pleroma Archive/World/Locations/Eos Multiverse/The Dark Forest Zone/Local Cluster/Totum/Verse Structure/Superclusters/Laniakea/Milky Way Galaxy/Sol System/Earth (Terra)/1890-2078/Economy & Infrastructure/Locations/Countries/Oman.md","x":1680,"y":29720,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"6b193e57c242ccdc","type":"text","text":"Triumph in America\nAmerica was one of the first western nations to break free of from the hold of the globalists regime. To the globalist elites disappointment America became a beacon of hope for the world once again. \n","x":-334,"y":29715,"width":340,"height":168},
		{"id":"662c792ab87430ed","type":"text","text":"Reconstruction Period\nFree to pursue anything, roughly a decade of rebuilding\n","x":-327,"y":29981,"width":326,"height":102},
		{"id":"5b0a715a559fdfee","type":"text","text":"Designer Babies\nDesigner babies are embryos or fetuses whose genetic makeup has been intentionally altered to achieve specific traits or to eliminate genetic diseases. This process often involves techniques like preimplantation genetic diagnosis (PGD) and genome editing technologies such as CRISPR, raising ethical concerns about potential social inequalities and the implications of modifying human genetics.\n","x":640,"y":30372,"width":321,"height":222},
		{"id":"47a618983526f8da","type":"file","file":"New Readers Start Here/I - Pleroma Archive/World/Locations/Eos Multiverse/The Dark Forest Zone/Local Cluster/Totum/Verse Structure/Superclusters/Laniakea/Milky Way Galaxy/Sol System/Earth (Terra)/1890-2078/Pre-WW3/Faction Profile/Alkebulan Union/Alkebulan Union.md","x":109,"y":31083,"width":400,"height":400,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"dfec8ecb1759a9ce","type":"text","text":"Alkebulan Representation\n\nWithin the Alkebulan Union, representation is given to all tribes and communities within each region, ensuring that no one group is excluded or ignored. The electoral system for council members is designed to reflect the diverse makeup of society, with representatives chosen based on their cultural background, social status, and level of experience. Women, youth, and other underrepresented groups are encouraged to run for office. Each council member serves a fixed term and is subject to regular oversight by their constituents. This helps to ensure that they remain accountable and transparent in their dealings, and that they are always working in the best interests of their people. In addition to direct elections, Alkebulan also uses a system of indirect representation where tribal and community leaders serve as advisors to the council. These leaders play a crucial role in bridging the gap between the local level and the regional level, helping to facilitate communication and collaboration between different groups. Overall, the Alkebulan Union places a strong emphasis on inclusivity and equality in representation. By empowering local voices and giving them a seat at the table, it creates a space for meaningful dialogue and decision-making that benefits everyone.\n","x":-400,"y":31096,"width":456,"height":375},
		{"id":"be12df25ae182e01","type":"text","text":"Ubuntu City\nUbuntu is the capital city of Alkebulan, located in the heart of the African Republic region. It is a bustling metropolis that reflects the rich cultural heritage of the region, with a mix of modern architecture and traditional African design elements. The city is home to many landmarks and attractions, including the Alkebulan National Museum, which showcases the continent's diverse art and history. The city's markets are a must-visit destination, where you can find everything from fresh produce and handmade crafts to unique souvenirs and gifts. One of the most notable features of Ubuntu is its vibrant and diverse cultural scene. The city hosts numerous festivals and events throughout the year, celebrating everything from traditional music and dance to contemporary art and cuisine. The federal government of Alkebulan is based in Ubuntu, and the city serves as a hub for diplomacy, business, and international relations. The government buildings are modern and efficient, but still retain a touch of traditional African style in their architecture and design. Despite its rapid growth and urbanization, Ubuntu has not lost its connection to its natural surroundings. The city is surrounded by lush forests, rolling hills, and fertile farmland, providing a beautiful backdrop to its urban landscape. Overall, Ubuntu is a thriving and dynamic city that embodies the best of Alkebulan's values of unity, diversity, and progress. It is a symbol of hope for a future where Africa's many cultures and traditions can come together to create something truly special.\n","x":-840,"y":31122,"width":366,"height":323},
		{"id":"3a2b9dfb403b16a5","type":"file","file":"New Readers Start Here/I - Pleroma Archive/World/Locations/Eos Multiverse/The Dark Forest Zone/Local Cluster/Totum/Verse Structure/Superclusters/Laniakea/Milky Way Galaxy/Sol System/Earth (Terra)/1890-2078/Pre-WW3/Faction Profile/CRINK/Union Reborn.md","x":109,"y":31483,"width":400,"height":400,"color":"6"},
